Z||000000||mrgone||06-24-2001||02:29 PM||||after painting my heat vents, i was getting in my car to go to the carwash.<P>put the key in, turned it to start, then i hear a funny noise, before the engine turned over. i froze in terror and let the car warm up. once the tach dropped after the warmup period i turned the car off.<BR>turned the key once again to the start position, heard what i think is the fuel pump hum, and nothing. engine doesnt crank, i dont think the starter is turning. i hope its the battery, i know it was on its way out.  any way i can test this?<P>roll it and drop clutch start it maybe?||||reg||1
