Z||000002||starfighter007@msn.com||06-24-2001||03:44 PM||||If you replace the whole starter your lookin at maybe $50.00 and it sounds like your on a really tight bugetIt is probobly the starter solenoid $15.00.do not cut insurance either one of these repairs can be done with some basic tools let us know how we can help if you want to do this .||||reg||11
