Z||000015||isthiswhereiputausername?||06-24-2001||07:57 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrgone:<BR><B>cept the big wire that looks like a ground coming from the battery was all rusted and felt loose, but was still connected</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>That could be your problem.. if its loose it wont work.. it could just be sparking when you try to start it.. try to move the wires as you get someone trying to start it (make sure hands are free from anything dangerous) <P>A loose starter wire or ground wire wont let the car start.. and could short out causing a fire..<P><BR>||||reg||1
